OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FSocial media sites were mentioned
OL,7,Fthousands of times during calls with
OL,8,FChildline last year, Good Morning
OL,9,FBritain Correspondent Philip Sime
OL,10,Freports
OL,12,FWords by ITV News Senior UK Producer
OL,13,FLiz Little
OL,15,FTikTok was the most-mentioned social
OL,16,Fmedia platform during counselling
OL,17,Fsessions with Childline over the last
OL,18,Fyear, according to a new survey shared
OL,19,Fexclusively with ITV News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FThe first of its kind survey by the
OL,7,FNational Society for the Prevention of
OL,8,FCruelty to Children (NSPCC) looked at
OL,9,Fthe number of times a range of
OL,10,Fplatforms and apps were discussed by
OL,11,Fyoung people - with the most common
OL,12,Fconcerns being mental health, online
OL,13,Fsexual abuse and exploitation.
OL,15,FBetween April 2025 and March 2026,
OL,16,FTikTok was mentioned 1,781 times
OL,17,Fduring the sessions - an average of
OL,18,Ffive times a day and a 37% rise on the
OL,19,Fprevious year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FOther top platforms mentioned include
OL,7,FSnapchat with 1,106 mentions,
OL,8,FInstagram with 569 mentions, Roblox
OL,9,Fwith 550 mentions and YouTube with 530
OL,10,Fmentions.
OL,12,FNSPCC CEO, Chris Sherwood, described
OL,13,Fthe results as "concerning but
OL,14,Funsurprising" and further evidence to
OL,15,Fsocial media giants "of their failures
OL,16,Fto give children safe and healthy
OL,17,Fexperiences online."
OL,26,@uD@POUvD@MO]wD@UOUyD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/16
