OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FIt's such safety failures which led to
OL,7,F'Kate' ` whose identity we are
OL,8,Fprotecting ` discovering that her 12-
OL,9,Fyear-old daughter had been groomed by
OL,10,Fa paedophile online.
OL,12,FAfter seeing suspicious notifications
OL,13,Fon her daughter's iPad, Kate went
OL,14,Fthrough her TikTok account and
OL,15,Fdiscovered "horrendous" messages.
OL,17,F"I started scrolling and scrolling and
OL,18,Frealised that there was something
OL,19,Freally bad that had happened. She'd
OL,20,Fbeen exposed to just dreadful,
OL,21,Fdreadful things."
OL,26,@wD@LOUwD@WO]}D@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FDespite having parental controls on
OL,7,Fher daughter's device, the man `
OL,8,Fposing as a teenager ` was able to
OL,9,Fsend indecent messages on TikTok
OL,10,Fbefore moving their conversation to
OL,11,FDiscord. There, an intense period of
OL,12,Fonline sexual abuse lasted for 11 days.
OL,14,FKate told ITV News: "He sent her a
OL,15,Fmessage saying, show me your p****.
OL,16,FAnd she replied, 'I haven't got a cat,
OL,17,FI've got a dog' - because that's how
OL,18,Finnocent she was, how naive she was."
OL,26,@vD@UOUzD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"And sometimes I just wonder, when
OL,7,Fwill it dawn on her? When will she
OL,8,Frealise that she was completely
OL,9,Fexploited?"
OL,11,FKate tells ITV News the impact on her
OL,12,Fdaughter has been long-lasting.
OL,14,F"She's wary of adults, I think she's
OL,15,Fparticularly wary of men and possibly
OL,16,Fmore mistrusting."
OL,18,FThe damage, she says, has also been
OL,19,Fwidespread.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@KO]vD@AOUxD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"The grief and the sadness that lives
OL,7,Fin me now because of what she saw, but
OL,8,Fwhat he did to her as well, it's
OL,9,Fabsolutely sickening."
OL,11,FKate is calling on social media
OL,12,Fplatforms to improve their safety
OL,13,Ffeatures and hopes that, by speaking
OL,14,Fout, she will save another family from
OL,15,Fenduring the same trauma.
OL,17,F"I just feel like all these different
OL,18,Fsocial media platforms, they're a
OL,19,Fplayground for paedophiles at the
OL,20,Fmoment."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@VO]yD@AOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"It's happening all the time. And we
OL,7,Fneed to stand up and say, enough is
OL,8,Fenough. We've got to find a way to
OL,9,Fprotect our children. It shouldn't be
OL,10,Fhappening."
OL,12,F"It shouldn't be about the greed of
OL,13,Fthese social media platforms - because
OL,14,Fthey have got the technology to police
OL,15,Fthis and to protect our children."
OL,17,FEarlier this year, the government
OL,18,Fannounced a social media ban for under-
OL,19,F16s in the UK. New Prime Minister Andy
OL,20,FBurnham has backed his predecessor's
OL,21,Fplan.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@KO]tD@AOUwD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FBut some, including Professor of
OL,7,FSocial Psychology at the London School
OL,8,Fof Economics, Sonia Livingstone,
OL,9,Fquestion whether a complete ban is the
OL,10,Fanswer.
OL,12,FProfessor Livingstone told ITV News:
OL,13,F"A ban, pure and simple, takes
OL,14,Fsomething from children and it doesn't
OL,15,Freally provide them with anything
OL,16,Fbetter."
OL,26,@xD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"We need parents and children to be
OL,7,Faware of the kinds of risks that
OL,8,Foccur. But what we really what we need
OL,9,Fis to step up the level of regulation
OL,10,Fso that these risks don't occur in the
OL,11,Ffirst place."
