OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FA government spokesperson, responding
OL,7,Fto the survey, told ITV News: "These
OL,8,Ffindings are a stark reminder of why
OL,9,Fwe're taking bold action to give
OL,10,Fchildren a safer, healthier childhood."
OL,12,F"That's why we're banning social media
OL,13,Fplatforms from offering their services
OL,14,Fto under-16s from next Spring and
OL,15,Fputting in wider protections to give
OL,16,Fkids their childhoods back. We're also
OL,17,Fgoing further by cracking down on
OL,18,Fharmful functions like livestreaming
OL,19,Fand stranger communication and AI
OL,20,Fchatbots that put children's safety at
OL,21,Frisk.
OL,26,@rD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"Platforms already have a legal duty
OL,7,Fto protect children from harmful
OL,8,Fmaterial, including pornography,
OL,9,Fviolent and abusive online content,
OL,10,Fand Ofcom has our full backing to take
OL,11,Faction where necessary."
OL,13,FTikTok told ITV News: "Teen accounts
OL,14,Fon TikTok have more than 50 preset
OL,15,Fprivacy and safety features from the
OL,16,Fmoment they join, and we use the
OL,17,Flatest technology to monitor and
OL,18,Fremove any content that attempts to
OL,19,Fexploit or harm young people. We
OL,20,Fdisagree with the misleading way this
OL,21,Fdata has been presented."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@XO]
