OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,FA Discord spokesperson said: "Discord
OL,7,Fis a communications platform built to
OL,8,Fconnect people around playing games.
OL,9,FOur safety systems combine advanced
OL,10,Ftechnology and human-led
OL,11,Finvestigations, alongside user reports
OL,12,Fto help identify accounts or spaces
OL,13,Fengaged in harmful activity.
OL,15,F"We take a proactive approach to
OL,16,Fcombatting bad actors who seek to
OL,17,Fabuse our service and continuously
OL,18,Finvest in improving our efforts.
OL,26,@nD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/16
