PN,30814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"Discord requires all users to be at
OL,7,Fleast 13 to use our platform and we
OL,8,Fbelieve nowhere is our safety work
OL,9,Fmore important than when it comes to
OL,10,Fteen users.
OL,12,F"We've built a suite of protections
OL,13,Ffor teen users that are now the
OL,14,Fdefault experience for all UK users,
OL,15,Fincluding sensitive content filters,
OL,16,Fsafety alerts on unfamiliar senders,
OL,17,Flimited visibility to content of
OL,18,Fmessage requests, and enhanced privacy
OL,19,Fsettings.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30815
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"We also provide teen users and their
OL,7,Fparents and guardians with important
OL,8,Fprivacy and safety tools, including
OL,9,FTeen Safety Assist and our Family
OL,10,FCenter."
OL,12,FSnapchat told ITV News: "Snapchat was
OL,13,Fdesigned to be different to other
OL,14,Fplatforms, with no open newsfeed or
OL,15,Flive stream, and public content is
OL,16,Fmoderated to help limit the virality
OL,17,Fof potentially harmful content.
OL,26,@rD@HO]tD@YOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
