OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30816
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786490291
OL,3,C'A playground for paedophiles': TikTok
OL,4,Crevealed as top app cited to Childline
OL,6,F"While we are encouraged to see the
OL,7,Fnumber of Snapchat mentions in calls
OL,8,Fto Childline consistently drop year on
OL,9,Fyear, the critical work to help keep
OL,10,FSnapchatters safe never stops. Earlier
OL,11,Fthis year, we committed to introducing
OL,12,Fstrong age checks for all UK
OL,13,FSnapchatters, and we will continue to
OL,14,Fwork with the NSPCC and other NGOs to
OL,15,Fsupport young people's safety."
OL,17,FMeta, which owns Instagram, failed to
OL,18,Frespond to ITV News' request for
OL,19,Fcomment. Roblox and YouTube also
OL,20,Fdeclined to comment.
OL,26,@wD@_O]
